{"id":1756225,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T11:50:16.367Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1756225,"imdb_id":"tt2046070","origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Ascent of the Jungfrau","overview":"\"A series of films taken during a difficult and dangerous ascent of the Jungfrau;, showing views of the climbers at an height of over 13,000 feet. The party consisted of Messrs. Charles Urban, G. A. Smith, F. Ormiston; Smith, the latter being the well-known mountaineer who has made a specialty of photography at high altitudes, and the two famous Bernese Oberland guides, Christian Bergenes and Hans Bernet. The following briefly indicates the incidents of each film, the whole series forming a grand conception of mountain climbing and its attendant difficulties and dangers :-The last drink before leaving the Chalet- previous to the start; Climbing the Jungfrau;-ascending the Gaggi Glacier, crevasses, slide, etc.; Climbing the Wetterhorn - difficult rock and precipice scaling ; Climbing the Jungfrau; - difficult ice and snow traversing, a slip, reaching summit; A lunch on the mountain and return of the climbers.\"","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[{"id":19681,"logo_path":null,"name":"Warwick Trading Company","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"GB","name":"United Kingdom"}],"release_date":"1901-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"No Language","iso_639_1":"xx","name":"No Language"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Ascent of the Jungfrau","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"external_ids":{"imdb_id":"tt2046070","wikidata_id":null,"facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":129166,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"Charles Urban","original_name":"Cha